828	     * Assigns the deterministic shared {@code householdId} to a newly created owner. The identifier
829	     * is derived from the owner's household identity — its {@code lastName} and {@code postcode} (see
830	     * {@link #householdIdFor(String, String)}) — so every owner sharing a last name and postcode
831	     * resolves to the same stable value automatically, without any explicit linking. An owner without
832	     * a postcode belongs to no shared household and is left without a household identifier.
833	     *
834	     * @param owner the newly created owner, mutated in place with its household identifier
835	     */
836	    private void assignHousehold(Owner owner) {
837	        owner.setHouseholdId(householdIdFor(owner.getLastName(), owner.getPostcode()));
838	    }
